# NV-04 — Phan quyen

UC: 31-40  
Actors: system administrator, unit manager  
Status: specified; baseline guards mocked; matrix implementation pending.

## Scope

Role/permission CRUD, assign/revoke roles, three data scopes (all/unit/assigned), effective-permission check and permission matrix.

## Acceptance criteria

- Route guard, action permission and data scope are evaluated separately.
- Revoking a role removes effective actions after session refresh/revocation.
- A user can be granted multiple roles; effective permission is the union constrained by scope.
- Every deny response is safe and does not reveal hidden records.

## Test mapping

`auth.guards.spec.ts`, `permission.service.spec.ts` (planned).

